          "path": "_m/c/0/p/y/astoria-oregon-wp/old-clatsop-county-jail-astori.jpg",
          "filename": "Old Clatsop County jail - Astoria Oregon.jpg",
          "caption": "The historic Old Clatsop County Jail (built 1913), located at 732 Duane Street in Astoria, Oregon, United States, is listed on the US National Register of Historic Places (NRHP). Since 1976, it is no longer in use as a jail, and in 2010 it was reopened as the Oregon Film Museum. A corner of the current sheriff's office and jail is narrowly visible in the right background of this photo. Photo was taken from the rear steps of the county courthouse.",
